  - title: LEVEL 16 | Circuit Overview
    explanation: Single series path through a 100-Ohm current limiter, a red LED,
      and a green LED. Both diodes must have forward polarity.
    caption: PAGE 1/4 | CIRCUIT TOPOLOGY
    parts:
    - id: battery
      kind: 0
      position: {x: 0.1, y: 0.5}
      label: 5 V DC
      color: {r: 0.99, g: 0.3, b: 0.4, a: 1}
    - id: switch
      kind: 5
      position: {x: 0.27, y: 0.82}
      label: SW1
      color: {r: 1, g: 0.79, b: 0.32, a: 1}
    - id: ground
